#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:9
msgid ""
"Caret is a terminal built with GTK 4 and libadwaita. Its text is drawn by "
"the GPU, pixel for pixel at any display scale."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:11
msgid ""
"Tabs with an overview, and new tabs and windows in the folder of the current "
"one"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:12
msgid ""
"Search through the history, selection by word or line, and addresses opened "
"with Ctrl and a click"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:13
msgid "Mouse reporting, bracketed paste, true colour, and underline styles"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:14
msgid "The desktop's monospace font and colour scheme, or ones of its own"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:21
msgid "sachesi"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:37
msgid "Tangent is now called Caret. Its settings start from the defaults."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:39
msgid ""
"New tabs open in the folder of the current one, and in its Toolbox or "
"Distrobox container, where the shell reports them"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:40
msgid ""
"Tabs show a running command, and a finished one or a notification in a tab "
"that is not in view; Ctrl+Shift+Up and Down scroll between prompts"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:41
msgid "Tabs can be renamed from their context menu"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:42
msgid "The title bar can be hidden, and is in full screen"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:43
msgid "Selecting with the mouse scrolls past the edge; Select All and Deselect"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:44
msgid ""
"The link under the pointer is underlined, and one a program broke into lines "
"is followed"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:45
msgid ""
"Symbols the font joins, such as -> and !=, are drawn joined, and a setting "
"turns features of the font on and off"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:46
msgid ""
"Settings for a command to run instead of the shell and for scrolling on "
"output and on keystroke"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:47
msgid ""
"Pasting several lines asks first where they would run, and programs can be "
"kept from notifying and from copying"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.caret.metainfo.xml:53
msgid "The first release."
msgstr ""

